 text-muted-foreground text-[14px] truncate w-full">postgres://db.example.test/shop</div></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-[24px] pl-[10px] mt-[6px]"><div class="border-t border-border"></div><label class="flex items-center gap-[12px] cursor-pointer justify-between"><div class="flex flex-col gap-[2px]"><div class="text-foreground">Calculadora</div><p class="text-muted-foreground text-[14px]">Evita errores de cálculo en LLMs</p></div><div class="relative inline-flex items-center mt-[4px]"><input class="peer sr-only" type="checkbox" checked=""><div class="
